Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.7 LoginEndpoints - GET /api/minimal/logins/{loginId}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/minimal/logins/{{loginId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.8 RegistrationEndpoints - POST /api/minimal/registrations
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/minimal/registrations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "registrationId": 0,
  "employeeSysId": {{employeeSysId}},
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "userSysId": {{userSysId}},
  "userType": "EMPLOYEE",
  "mobileNo": "9876543210",
  "imeiNo": "{{imeiNo}}",
  "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}",
  "deviceType": "{{deviceType}}"
}

### 3.9 RegistrationEndpoints - GET /api/minimal/registrations/{registrationId}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/minimal/registrations/{{registrationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.10 RegistrationEndpoints - GET /api/minimal/registrations/user/{userId}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/minimal/registrations/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.11 RegistrationEndpoints - GET /api/minimal/registrations/status/{status}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/minimal/registrations/status/P
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

