### 3.13 RegistrationEndpoints - POST /api/minimal/registrations/{registrationId}/generate-pin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/minimal/registrations/{{registrationId}}/generate-pin
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ============================================
### 4. GRAPHQL ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 4.1 GraphQL - Query: GetDevicesByEmployee
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { getDevicesByEmployee(employeeSysId: {{employeeSysId}}) { employeeSysId deviceId deviceType imeiNo } }"
}

### 4.2 GraphQL - Query: GetDevice
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { getDevice(employeeSysId: {{employeeSysId}}, deviceId: \"{{deviceId}}\") { employeeSysId deviceId deviceType } }"
}

### 4.3 GraphQL - Query: GetLoginsByUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { getLoginsByUser(userSysId: {{userSysId}}) { loginId userSysId deviceId } }"
}

### 4.4 GraphQL - Query: GetLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { getLogin(loginId: {{loginId}}) { loginId userSysId deviceId imeiNo } }"
}

### 4.5 GraphQL - Query: GetRegistration
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { getRegistration(registrationId: {{registrationId}}) { registrationId employeeSysId userId userSysId status } }"
}

### 4.6 GraphQL - Query: GetRegistrationsByUserId
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { getRegistrationsByUserId(userId: \"{{userId}}\") { registrationId employeeSysId userId status } }"
}

### 4.7 GraphQL - Query: GetRegistrationsByStatus
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { getRegistrationsByStatus(status: \"P\") { registrationId userId status } }"
}

### 4.8 GraphQL - Mutation: RegisterDevice
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { registerDevice(employeeSysId: {{employeeSysId}}, deviceId: \"GRAPHQL_DEVICE\", deviceType: \"{{deviceType}}\", imeiNo: \"{{imeiNo}}\", updatedBy: \"ADMIN\") { employeeSysId deviceId } }"
}

### 4.9 GraphQL - Mutation: DeactivateDevice
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { deactivateDevice(employeeSysId: {{employeeSysId}}, deviceId: \"{{deviceId}}\", updatedBy: \"ADMIN\") { employeeSysId deviceId } }"
}

### 4.10 GraphQL - Mutation: LogUserLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { logUserLogin(userSysId: {{userSysId}}, deviceId: \"{{deviceId}}\", imeiNo: \"{{imeiNo}}\", deviceType: \"{{deviceType}}\") { loginId userSysId deviceId } }"
}

### 4.11 GraphQL - Mutation: CreateRegistration
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { createRegistration(registrationId: 0, employeeSysId: {{employeeSysId}}, userId: \"{{userId}}\", userSysId: {{userSysId}}, userType: \"EMPLOYEE\", mobileNo: \"9876543210\", imeiNo: \"{{imeiNo}}\", deviceId: \"{{deviceId}}\", deviceType: \"{{deviceType}}\") { registrationId employeeSysId userId } }"
}

### 4.12 GraphQL - Mutation: UpdateRegistrationStatus
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { updateRegistrationStatus(registrationId: {{registrationId}}, newStatus: \"A\") { registrationId status } }"
}

### 4.13 GraphQL - Mutation: GenerateRegistrationPin
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { generateRegistrationPin(registrationId: {{registrationId}}) { registrationId pin } }"
}

